    "rule": "Manifest rotation of the same-family subagent. The n-th base configuration (0-based, manifest order) that uses a listed template places the same-family slot row at slot_cycle[n mod 4]; the other-family rows keep their offsets 0, 1, 2 and fill the remaining slots in slot order. The assignment depends only on base_configuration_id, so it is shared by all scenarios and evaluated systems."
